<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Service Corp a strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Service Corp a strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Service Corp International as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 29-1/4 Wednesday.  </p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for details.</p>
